{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Overview]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;DebugDebut&quot; is a simulation game where you earn money by doing serious debugging work.<br>An app that suddenly appears on your desktop.<br>When you start it up, an AI that generates games starts up.<br>This AI is still new and doesn't seem to be able to make games well.<br>So you become the debugger and start pointing out bugs in the game to fix them.<br>Can you point them out without making any mistakes?<br>And what is the true identity of this app?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Game Description]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to find all the bugs in the game.<br>Read through the game description written on the checklist<br>Operate and check the game while comparing it with the description and materials.<br>Find all the behaviors that don't match the game behavior and the checklist items.<br>Bugs include simple ones such as</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character doesn't move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The UI isn't reflected</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only enemy D is invincible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only block E is hit and miss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you leave a certain screen for 2 minutes, it suddenly crashes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more.<br>There is more than one game to debug.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more.<br>If you miss a bug three times while debugging all the games,<br>you will lose the AI's trust and the debugging process will end.<br>Check carefully to avoid mistakes.<br>You can also use the rewards you get from debugging to make<br>extensions to make debugging easier.<br>Aim for the best debugging environment by preparing cheat tools that suit the game and asking for help from friends.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Play time]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 to 5 hours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[About video streaming]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please check the official website.</p></p></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3387340?t=1766412712","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3387340?t=1766412712","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387340/fd467934780cd530eefab7dcfcd20639ecd43cd0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766412712","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387340/fd467934780cd530eefab7dcfcd20639ecd43cd0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766412712","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Overview]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;DebugDebut&quot; is a simulation game where you earn money by doing serious debugging work.<br>An app that suddenly appears on your desktop.<br>When you start it up, an AI that generates games starts up.<br>This AI is still new and doesn't seem to be able to make games well.<br>So you become the debugger and start pointing out bugs in the game to fix them.<br>Can you point them out without making any mistakes?<br>And what is the true identity of this app?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Game Description]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to find all the bugs in the game.<br>Read through the game description written on the checklist<br>Operate and check the game while comparing it with the description and materials.<br>Find all the behaviors that don't match the game behavior and the checklist items.<br>Bugs include simple ones such as</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The character doesn't move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No sound</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The UI isn't reflected</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only enemy D is invincible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only block E is hit and miss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you leave a certain screen for 2 minutes, it suddenly crashes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and more.<br>There is more than one game to debug.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shooting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more.<br>If you miss a bug three times while debugging all the games,<br>you will lose the AI's trust and the debugging process will end.<br>Check carefully to avoid mistakes.<br>You can also use the rewards you get from debugging to make<br>extensions to make debugging easier.<br>Aim for the best debugging environment by preparing cheat tools that suit the game and asking for help from friends.<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Play time]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 to 5 hours</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[About video streaming]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please check the official website.</p></p></p>","developers":["BeaverDevelopment"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3387340/143fcbe0ce450185fddab5f1cd6b4f767fba6984/header.jpg?t=1766412712","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements